lign: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/adcc0367546beec10c1311a088bdaef9.avif?t=1786809940\" alt=\"Hiro and Ventauri in EDEN&#039;S FRONTIER.\" width=650 height=613 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and vital, the <strong>Folhiel</strong> are known as the <i>“</i>conscious seeds<i>”</i> of Eden. Their peculiar appearance resembling small onions with curious expressions may draw smiles at first glance, but their importance goes far beyond their simple form. They are guardians of nature itself;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras/464f7095fb3f126ff1952331864b089b.avif?t=1786809940\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397010/extras_big/464f7095fb3f126ff1952331864b089b.webp?t=1786809940 width=1560 height=621 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans, mold monsters, other yet-to-be-discovered creatures, and even clowns (?) inhabit Eden! Begin your journey in the Chlorophyll Forest and uncover unforgettable regions in an EPIC adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">➤ Don’t forget to visit our <strong>official website</strong> and <strong>follow us on social media</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "EDEN’S FRONTIER is an Action RPG inspired by works from the 90s and 2000s. Pixel art + 3D environments, deep narrative, dynamic combat, and exploration, all set in the same universe as its manga! In the first demo, you are a young Bluveil, beginning an epic journey of discovery."